# Oreburgh City with the Explorer Kit registered to Y and the Underground never
# visited: Y opens the first-visit path (the comms confirm, the forced save, the
# hole, Roark's intro). CanUseExplorerKit allows this main-matrix map.
name GQ
gender GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 26091
money 3000
var VAR_PLAYER_STARTER SPECIES_TURTWIG
party SPECIES_TURTWIG 15 ITEM_NONE
item ITEM_EXPLORER_KIT 1
register-item ITEM_EXPLORER_KIT
flag FLAG_RECEIVED_EXPLORER_KIT
map MAP_HEADER_OREBURGH_CITY 0x12F 0x2F5 FACE_DOWN
